<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gables raised, Post cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gables raised, Post cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Jonathan Litt raised Gables Residential Trust to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Gables Residential gained 1/4 to 26-11/16.</p>
<p>-- PaineWebber also said Litt cut Post Properties Inc to unattractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- additional details were not available on the Post Properties downgrade.</p>
<p>-- Post Properties was off 9/16 to 39-7/8.</p>
</text>
